{"id":"emergency-alerts","name":"Emergency Alerts","tagline":"Receive emergency alerts","blurb":"Emergency Alerts is a simple app that sends you alerts for your locations.","description":"Emergency Alerts is a simple app that sends you alerts for your locations. Supported countries include Germany, the US (only weather alerts) and Ukraine (only air raid alerts) with more countries coming soon!\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Receive flood and weather warnings\n\n• Receive alerts from your local civil protection authority\n\n• Quickly view alerts for your favorite locations on the dashboard\n\n• View alerts from all over the world on the map\n\n• Get notifications when new alerts are issued for your saved locations\n\n• Support for Germany, the US (only weather alerts) and Ukraine (only air raid alerts) with more countries coming soon","developer":"Leonhard","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.emergency-alerts/f4677dae74e90534cc8e49ddab15e2af/icons/128x128/io.github.leolost2605.emergency-alerts.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.emergency-alerts/f4677dae74e90534cc8e49ddab15e2af/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.emergency-alerts/f4677dae74e90534cc8e49ddab15e2af/screenshots/image-1_1248x759@1.png","w":1940,"h":1180},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.emergency-alerts/f4677dae74e90534cc8e49ddab15e2af/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.emergency-alerts/f4677dae74e90534cc8e49ddab15e2af/screenshots/image-2_1248x759@1.png","w":1940,"h":1180},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.emergency-alerts/f4677dae74e90534cc8e49ddab15e2af/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.emergency-alerts/f4677dae74e90534cc8e49ddab15e2af/screenshots/image-3_1248x759@1.png","w":1940,"h":1180},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github